---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Bonfire — About
description: Bonfire is a mission-driven project creating sustainable open-source tools and building blocks for communities — for the communities, by the community.
---

{% set eyebrow = "flex items-center gap-3 font-smono text-[1rem] font-bold tracking-[.18em]" %}
{% set display = "mt-4 font-disp font-[560] text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.3rem)] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-.02em] text-balance [font-variation-settings:'opsz'_96]" %}
{% set bodyp = "mt-5 text-[1.05rem] text-ink-2 max-w-[42rem] [&_a]:text-spark [&_a:hover]:underline [&_b]:text-ink [&_b]:font-semibold" %}
{% set personcard = "block text-center group" %}
{% set personimg = "w-full aspect-square rounded-xl object-cover border border-ink/15 bg-night-2 group-hover:border-flame/40" %}
{% set personname = "mt-3 font-disp font-[620] text-base text-ink" %}

<div class="relative overflow-x-clip bg-night text-ink font-body leading-[1.55] antialiased selection:bg-ember selection:text-[#160c02]">
  <div class="v2-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="relative z-[1]">

    {# ===== header ===== #}
    <header class="pt-10 pb-2.5">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <h1 class="font-disp font-semibold text-[clamp(2.1rem,5vw,3.7rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-.02em] max-w-[17ch] text-balance [font-variation-settings:'opsz'_96]">Building open digital spaces for <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_commons_(economics)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fire-text">the commons</a>.</h1>
      <p class="mt-[18px] font-disp font-normal text-[clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.6rem)] leading-[1.3] text-ink max-w-[46ch]">We envision a world where all living beings thrive and communities flourish, free from private interests and capitalistic control.</p>
      <div class="relative mt-10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-ink/15">
        <img class="w-full max-h-[440px] object-cover block" src="/img/about.png" alt="" loading="lazy">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-[linear-gradient(to_top,rgba(12,14,21,.55),transparent_40%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </div></header>

    {# ===== mission ===== #}
    <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">The mission</p>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">Started in 2020, Bonfire is a mission-driven project creating sustainable open-source tools and building blocks for communities to engage meaningfully, coordinate as peers, make collective decisions, and cooperate effectively – all interconnected with countless federated apps across the web. We're dedicated to nurturing digital spaces that encourage vibrant community participation and impactful collaboration.</p>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">We endeavour to foster a transparent, inclusive, and empowering environment. This ethos drives us to build connected, democratic, and vibrant digital spaces, supporting communities around the world to connect, grow, and flourish.</p>
    </div></section>

    {# ===== the collective ===== #}
    <section class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-corn">How we're organised</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[24ch]">For the communities, <span class="font-light">by the community.</span></h2>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">Bonfire Networks is an online collective. Our finances are transparently managed through <a href="https://opencollective.com/bonfire-networks" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our Open Collective account</a>. Bonfire is a not-for-profit project funded by donations and grants, and not by private investors or venture capital. We strive to work as closely as possible with communities, to build tools together that reflect their real needs.</p>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">We welcome feedback and collaboration with communities, researchers, and activists to tailor solutions or create new features that enhance the development of better digital public spaces. All Bonfire code is open source, licensed under <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.en.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AGPL3</a>, which means all features or improvements made by anyone can benefit the whole ecosystem.</p>
    </div></section>

    {# ===== people ===== #}
    <section class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">The people</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[24ch]">Meet the builders <span class="font-light">of Bonfire.</span></h2>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">We adopt a consent-based <a href="https://www.sociocracyforall.org/sociocracy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">sociocratic model</a> to coordinate tasks and make decisions among us. If you are interested in actively participating in our collective and pushing Bonfire forward we invite you to abide by our <a href="/conduct">code of conduct</a> and get involved!</p>

      <p class="mt-10 font-smono text-[.72rem] font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-ink-3">Maintainers circle</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-md mt-5">
        <a class="{{ personcard }}" href="https://mayel.space/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <img class="{{ personimg }}" src="/img/mayel.png" alt="Mayel de Borniol" loading="lazy">
          <div class="{{ personname }}">Mayel de Borniol</div>
        </a>
        <a class="{{ personcard }}" href="https://ivan.cafe/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <img class="{{ personimg }}" src="/img/ivan.png" alt="Ivan Minutillo" loading="lazy">
          <div class="{{ personname }}">Ivan Minutillo</div>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div></section>

  </div>
</div>
